# the ice. Slow and far apart, glassy bells over a cold pad, every note
# left to ring out. E minor, with a C that almost warms it up.
tempo 60
rows 4

inst bell  triangle vol 0.11 attack 0.003 decay 2.2 sustain 0.0
inst glass sine     vol 0.08 attack 0.002 decay 1.4 sustain 0.0
inst pad   sine     vol 0.11 attack 1.2 decay 1.0 sustain 0.8 release 1.6 vibrato 0.003
inst bass  sine     vol 0.20 attack 0.2 decay 1.2 sustain 0.5 release 1.0

pattern em
bell  E5 .  .  .  | B4 .  .  .  | .  .  G5 . | .  .  .  .
glass .  .  B5 .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | E6 .  .  .
pad   G4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | .  .  .  .
bass  E2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | B1 .  .  .

pattern c
bell  G5 .  .  .  | E5 .  .  .  | .  .  C5 . | .  .  .  .
glass .  .  .  .  | .  .  G5 .  | .  .  .  . | .  .  .  .
pad   E4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | .  .  .  .
bass  C2 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | G1 .  .  .

pattern am
bell  A4 .  .  .  | .  .  C5 .  | E5 .  .  . | .  .  .  .
glass .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  A5 . | .  .  .  .
pad   C4 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | .  .  .  .
bass  A1 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | E2 .  .  .

pattern b
bell  F#5 . .  .  | D#5 . .  .  | .  .  B4 . | .  .  .  .
glass .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | F#5 . .  .
pad   D#4 . .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | .  .  .  -
bass  B1 .  .  .  | .  .  .  .  | .  .  .  . | F#1 . .  .

order em c am b em c am em
